  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A planet of mass m is in a circular orbit of radius R around a star. The orbital speed of the planet is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. A second planet of mass 2m is in a circular orbit of radius 1.5R around the same star.</p>\n<p>What is the orbital speed of the second planet?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}v}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2v}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{3v}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v\"></span></li></ol>"
